{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026dgWsYt1nyu1793180044.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>[18:09更新]</p><p>新華社報道，在西班牙相撞列車上的一名中國公民說，與其同行的3名中國公民中有人受輕傷，車上乘客正被疏散。</p><p></p><p>[17:50]</p><p>西班牙傳體報道，在中部城市托萊多附近的高速鐵路列車相撞事故，已造成至少46人死亡。</p><p></p><p>[17:44]</p><p>西班牙一段高速鐵路有兩列火車相撞，據報死亡人數增至39人，首相桑切斯對事故深感震驚，向所有遇難者家屬表示慰問和支持。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T10:21:35.793896+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T10:09:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T10:38:20.553412+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T10:18:21.350036+00:00","content_hash":"488829e419154de1633e6c535357e1b767a600fb08a8ee8c8cbd94fb901d334d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T10:21:35.793896+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}